# Army destruction flipbook art is provided locally by the artist, never via Git.
# Keep Unity importer .meta files versioned; only the image data is local.
# WARNING: Back up these four PNGs before pulling the commit that untracks them.
/Assets/Resources/ArmyDestruction/*.png

# This downloadable archive embeds those local-only PNG atlases.
/Docs/Exports/ArmyDestruction_Images.zip
